    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1_capi_ev_t",
      "x": 104, "y": 323, "width": 1392, "height": 169,
      "text": "/var/www/.htpasswd-docs        18 accounts,  $apr1$…  (MD5-crypt)\n\n/docs/.htaccess         Require user <name> <name> …      <- tier: field\n/docs/data/.htaccess    Require user <name> <name> …      <- tier: staff\n/docs/admin/.htaccess   Require user <name> …             <- tier: admin\n\nA \"role\" IS the list of usernames inside a file.\nSessions: mod_session_cookie — stateless, 8 h, logout CANNOT revoke.\nGate matches by FILENAME -> a new file under /docs/ is public until listed.",
      "originalText": "/var/www/.htpasswd-docs        18 accounts,  $apr1$…  (MD5-crypt)\n\n/docs/.htaccess         Require user <name> <name> …      <- tier: field\n/docs/data/.htaccess    Require user <name> <name> …      <- tier: staff\n/docs/admin/.htaccess   Require user <name> …             <- tier: admin\n\nA \"role\" IS the list of usernames inside a file.\nSessions: mod_session_cookie — stateless, 8 h, logout CANNOT revoke.\nGate matches by FILENAME -> a new file under /docs/ is public until listed.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 100017, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100018, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s1_f2_ev",
      "x": 1920, "y": 297, "width": 1440, "height": 230,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 100019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100020, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1_f2_ev_t",
      "x": 1944, "y": 317, "width": 1392, "height": 188,
      "text": "worker/src/admin/handlers/users.ts\n  PERM_KEYS = [ dash_data, dash_report, dash_apps, dash_users, dash_roles,\n                dict_self_admin_up/down, dict_paper_encoded_up/down,\n                dict_capi_up/down ]\n\nadmin JWT   { sub, role, role_version, jti, iat, pwc }   PBKDF2-SHA256 x100k\nKV F2_AUTH  revoked_jti:<jti>     <- logout kills that one token\n            revoked_user:<sub>    <- admin kills every token the user holds\n\nStore:  Google Sheets  F2_Users / F2_Roles  --Apps Script-->  Worker",
      "originalText": "worker/src/admin/handlers/users.ts\n  PERM_KEYS = [ dash_data, dash_report, dash_apps, dash_users, dash_roles,\n                dict_self_admin_up/down, dict_paper_encoded_up/down,\n                dict_capi_up/down ]\n\nadmin JWT   { sub, role, role_version, jti, iat, pwc }   PBKDF2-SHA256 x100k\nKV F2_AUTH  revoked_jti:<jti>     <- logout kills that one token\n            revoked_user:<sub>    <- admin kills every token the user holds\n\nStore:  Google Sheets  F2_Users / F2_Roles  --Apps Script-->  Worker",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 100021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100022, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
