    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s4c_ev",
      "x": 2345, "y": 1215, "width": 990, "height": 90,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400046, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4c_ev_t",
      "x": 2365, "y": 1233, "width": 950, "height": 49,
      "text": "Phase 2 swaps ONE module. worker/src/admin/handlers/*.ts calls Apps Script today;\npoint those same calls at  https://capi.asiansocial.org/authz/*  instead.\nF2 keeps its UI, JWTs and screens. Only the store moves — toward MySQL, not away.",
      "originalText": "Phase 2 swaps ONE module. worker/src/admin/handlers/*.ts calls Apps Script today;\npoint those same calls at  https://capi.asiansocial.org/authz/*  instead.\nF2 keeps its UI, JWTs and screens. Only the store moves — toward MySQL, not away.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400048, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4c_pros",
      "x": 2320, "y": 1350, "width": 1040, "height": 80,
      "text": "✓  Ends with ONE identity system — the integration actually lands\n✓  The merge runs toward the stronger store, not into a spreadsheet\n✓  Phase 1 ships now; F2 stays frozen through pretest\n✓  Console stays up even when Cloudflare or Sheets is not",
      "originalText": "✓  Ends with ONE identity system — the integration actually lands\n✓  The merge runs toward the stronger store, not into a spreadsheet\n✓  Phase 1 ships now; F2 stays frozen through pretest\n✓  Console stays up even when Cloudflare or Sheets is not",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400050, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4c_caveats",
      "x": 2320, "y": 1442, "width": 1040, "height": 40,
      "text": "○  Phase 2 needs the Worker to reach the box over HTTPS\n○  A little more design up front: built for two consumers",
      "originalText": "○  Phase 2 needs the Worker to reach the box over HTTPS\n○  A little more design up front: built for two consumers",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400052, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
